{"suttaId":"tha-ap323","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9428,9447],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap323:0.3":"Umāpupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap323:1.1":"“Samāhitaṃ samāpannaṃ, siddhatthamaparājitaṃ;","tha-ap323:1.3":"Samādhinā upaviṭṭhaṃ, addasāhaṃ naruttamaṃ.","tha-ap323:2.1":"“Umāpupphaṃ gahetvāna, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap323:2.3":"Sabbapupphā ekasīsā, uddhaṃvaṇṭā adhomukhā.","tha-ap323:3.1":"“Sucittā viya tiṭṭhante, ākāse pupphasantharā;","tha-ap323:3.3":"Tena cittappasādena, tusitaṃ upapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap323:4.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap323:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap323:5.1":"“Pañcapaññāsito kappe, eko āsiṃ mahīpati;","tha-ap323:5.3":"Samantachadano nāma, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap323:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap323:6.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap323:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā umāpupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap323:8.1":"Umāpupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
